<title>UK: McDonnell Info to issue shares to Motorola.</title>
<headline>McDonnell Info to issue shares to Motorola.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK's McDonnell Information Systems Group said on Tuesday that it had agreed to issue 4.7 million new ordinary shares of 10 pence each to Motorola Inc in settlement of future royalty commitments of 3.7 million stg.</p>
<p>The new shares represent 4.5 percent of the enlarged issued share capital of McDonnell Information.</p>
<p>The company said the application for listing was made on Monday and it was expected to become effective on November 28, 1996.</p>
<p>Motorola would have a restriction on sale of shares for 12 months following allotment.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44-171-542 7717</p>
</text>
